# Community Point Ledger Entry
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Community — gamification points, ledger-shaped like Case 6's Petty Cash Voucher
# (append-only entries that sum to a running total) — not itself a new pattern.
# Case 12 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: community-badge-award.menata

Point Ledger Entry

Fields

- Member : User
- Points : Number
- Reason : Joined Group | Posted Status | Hosted Event | Attended Event
- Awarded At : Date

Events

When Award

    if sum of Point Ledger Entry Points for this Member is greater than or equal to 100

        Award Badge

Constraints

- Member is required.
- Points is required.
- Reason is required.

Permissions

System

- Award

Views

- My Points : List
- Leaderboard : Report
